坐的凳子，几人直直的走进了贾氏的房间。贾氏尴尬的笑笑：“小荷坐床上吧。”“嗯，我们这姐妹间的你何须跟我客气，这等你生完后我来照顾你一些时日好了。”余小荷随着她在旁边坐下，伸手抚摸上她浑圆的肚子。“这怎么好意思呢，眼看着就要到农忙的季节了，你家里也忙不过来吧。”贾氏朝她笑笑，这村里田地最多的就属他们家了，虽有一大家子人，劳动力却只有她们姐妹两跟她丈夫，哪里还能抽的出时间。“可是，婶子年纪大了，小凡还太年轻，如何能照顾好你。”余小荷扫了一眼苏小凡，满眼不放心。“堂婶你就不用操心了，到时候奶奶教我，我来做就好了。”苏小凡转头见萧遗墨正缓缓走进来，欺身上前就将他直接抱到了床上坐着。萧遗墨无语加气愤的怒瞪着她，这女人真是不长记性，都说了好几次，不要随便抱自己，她怎么就是记不住呢？“好了，别生气，乖乖坐着。”苏小凡笑着抚摸了几下他的头。“我怎么感觉小凡像是在带儿子呀？”余小西捂着嘴偷乐。“就我这年龄，哪能有这么大一个儿子呀。”苏小凡毫不在意的笑笑，然后感触颇深的说：“日后啊，我要是能有这么一个水灵灵的孩子就好了。”听到这个，贾氏无比幽怨的望了一眼苏小凡，低低的说：“都是娘不好，若是家里条件好点，何至于让你还得苦等那么些年，这明年小西都要成亲了，隔年就能有孩子……”苏小凡敛了脸上的笑，一本正经的打断了她的话：“娘啊，日后别在说这个了，十六岁结婚那是早婚你知道吗？人家三十好几才结婚呢。”“三十好几？”余小西吃惊的望向她，这不管是男还是女，到了三十好几若是还没成亲，那肯定是因为有各种各样的问题，而且说不准一生都得一个人过了。“啊……嘿嘿，我就那么随口说的。”苏小凡咂咂嘴，不知不觉的就把自己前世的东西说出口了，在这个世界应该是很少有三十好几才结婚的。“芷烟。”屋外传来了叶氏的声音，几人都起身，走了出去。几人出去的时候，叶氏刚将手中的东西放入厨房，见到出来的几人后，满是吃惊的问：“那只野鸡是哪来的？”“凡儿从山上带回来的。”说起这个，贾氏也很疑惑的转头问苏小凡：“凡儿，这是怎么抓到的，这山上的野鸡跑的那可是相当的快呀，很少有人能抓到它们的。”“嘿嘿，就是把菜刀扔出去砍断了它脚，所以它跑不了勒，一会儿我给娘炖了补一补。”苏小凡走进厨房看了看奶奶买回来的那些东西，有少量的大米，一些玉米面儿，还有些红糖花生什么的，想必是为娘准备的。“菜刀？”贾氏依旧满腹疑惑，这菜刀能扔多远呀。“嗯……”苏小凡绕绕头，急忙转移话题：“这不是想给娘好好的补一补嘛，娘你太瘦了，明明是个孕妇。”“是该好好补补了，我家里还有些黄豆，一会儿让小西给你送过来。”余小荷浅浅笑着，看向贾氏的目光里，带着几许羡慕。贾氏眸子转动了几下，低声说：“小荷别想太多，你还年轻，迟早会有孩子的。”余小荷颇有些无奈的轻叹了一口气：“大夫说落胎次数太多，即便是再怀上，恐怕也会跟前几次一般，所以虎子说，暂时不要，等日后存些钱去县里看看再说。”贾氏点点头：“这样也好，老是落胎，伤身。”“嗯。”余小荷笑笑：“那么我们就先回去了，你好好休息。”“好，我送你吧。”贾氏单手撑着腰，面上略显疲惫。“不用了，你好好休息。”余小荷出手按住了她的手，示意她停下不用相送，然后对叶氏说：“婶子，我先走了。”“好，得空的时候来陪陪芷烟。”叶氏走了过去，从袖中掏出了几个碎银子放到余小荷的手中后说：“就剩下这些了，先还你们家一些吧。”“婶子，还是先留着吧，这芷烟生孩子还得用钱请稳婆呀。”余小荷又将碎银子放了回去。叶氏想想确实也是，如果自己替她接生，有很大的风险，还是留些银子请稳婆的好：“那么老婶子我就谢谢你了。”余小荷微微一笑：“婶子严重了，先走了，改日再来。”“嗯，慢走。”叶氏目送她们离开后，就吩咐贾氏去屋内休息，然后进了厨房准备收拾凡儿弄来的那只野鸡。苏小凡跟进厨房在她身后站了片刻后说：“奶奶，你也去休息吧，还是我来好了。”叶氏回身：“凡儿几时学会杀鸡了？”", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/chongfuchengyin-nongjiatongyangxi/10.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 10 Killing the Chicken \"Zhiyan, come in and sit for a while. By this month of your life, you will be exhausted from standing all the time.\" Yu Xiaohe stepped forward and helped Jia into the house. Seeing Xiao Yimo leaning outside the hall door, he said with a smile: \"The grandson of the village chief's family is really handsome, but Xiaofan has to wait for so many years.\" \"Yes, ten years later, Xiaofan will become an old girl.\" Yu Xiaoxi looked at Su Xiaofan with sympathy. Su Xiaofan smiled foolishly: \"What's the matter? It will be him who will suffer the loss then, not me.\" Yu Xiaoxi blinked and asked doubtfully: \"Why him?\" \"I am fifteen years old now, and I will be twenty-five in ten years, but he will not be sixteen until ten years. I am the old cow eating the young grass, so I must have taken advantage.\" Su Xiaofan turned around and saw Xiao Yimo staring at him hatefully, and he was even more confused. Why did the village chief choose him? Their family is not short of money, and this little baby is so charming. What kind of woman will he want in the future? \"What will you do if he dislikes you then?\" Yu Xiaoxi is not as optimistic as she is. These men with a little money all have three wives and four concubines. In the future, when Xiaofan gets old, how will he be able to fight against those little vixens. \"Well, don't worry, we'll make it up to you then.\" Su Xiaofan followed them into the house. Who knows what will happen in the future? It's useless to think about it any more. Since there were no stools to sit on in the hall, several people walked straight into Jia's room. Jia Shi smiled awkwardly: \"Xiaohe, please sit on the bed.\" \"Well, between us sisters, why do you have to be polite to me? I'll take care of you for a while after you give birth.\" Yu Xiaohe followed her and sat down next to her, reaching out to touch her round belly. \"Why are you so embarrassed? It's almost the busy farming season, and your family won't be able to handle it.\" Mrs. Jia smiled at her. Their family had the most fields in the village. Although they had a large family, the only labor force was the two sisters and her husband, so how could they spare the time. \"But, my aunt is old and Xiaofan is still too young. How can I take good care of you?\" Yu Xiaohe glanced at Su Xiaofan, his eyes full of worry. \"Auntie, you don't have to worry. Grandma will teach me and I will do it.\" Su Xiaofan turned around and saw Xiao Yimo slowly walking in. He stepped forward and hugged him directly to the bed and sat down. Xiao Yimo stared at her speechlessly and angrily. This woman really didn't have a long memory. She had told her several times not to hug herself casually. Why couldn't she remember it? \"Okay, don't be angry, just sit down.\" Su Xiaofan smiled and stroked his head a few times. \"Why do I feel like Xiaofan is taking care of his son?\" Yu Xiaoxi covered her mouth in amusement. \"How can I have such a big son at my age?\" Su Xiaofan smiled nonchalantly, and then said with deep emotion: \"In the future, it would be great if I could have such a beautiful child.\" Hearing this, Jia glanced at Su Xiaofan with great resentment, and said in a low voice: \"It's all my mother's fault. If the family's conditions were better, why would you have to wait so many years? Xiaoxi will get married next year, and she will be able to do it the next year. Have children...\" Su Xiaofan suppressed the smile on his face and interrupted her seriously: \"Mom, don't talk about this in the future. Marrying at sixteen is an early marriage, you know? People don't get married until their thirties.\" \"What's thirty?\" Yu Xiaoxi looked at her in surprise. Whether it's a boy or a girl, if they haven't gotten married in their thirties, it must be because of various problems, and they may have to live alone for the rest of their lives. \"Ah...hehe, I just said it casually.\" Su Xiaofan smacked his lips and unknowingly said something about his past life. In this world, it is rare for people to get married in their thirties. \"Zhiyan.\" Ye's voice came from outside the house, and several people stood up and walked out. When a few people went out, Mrs. Ye just put the things in her hands into the kitchen. When she saw the few people who came out, she asked in surprise: \"Where did that pheasant come from?\" \"Fan'er brought it back from the mountain.\" Speaking of this, Jia Shi also turned to Su Xiaofan in confusion: \"Fan'er, how did you catch this? The pheasants on this mountain can run very fast. Yeah, very few people can catch them. \"Hey, I just threw the kitchen knife and cut off its legs, so it couldn't run away. I'll make some stew for my mother later.\" Su Xiaofan walked into the kitchen and looked at the things grandma bought. There was a small amount of rice, some cornmeal, and some brown sugar peanuts, which must have been prepared for my mother. \"Chop knife?\" Jia was still full of doubts about how far this kitchen knife could be thrown. \"Hmm...\" Su Xiaofan twisted his head and hurriedly changed the subject: \"Don't you want to give Mom a good replenishment? Mom, you are too thin and you are obviously a pregnant woman.\" \"It's time for a good replenishment. I still have some soybeans at home. I'll ask Xiaoxi to bring them to you later.\" Yu Xiaohe smiled lightly and looked at Jia with a bit of envy. Jia's eyes rolled a few times and whispered: \"Xiaohe, don't think too much. You are still young. You will have children sooner or later.\" Yu Xiaohe sighed helplessly: \"The doctor said that there are too many miscarriages, and even if you get pregnant again, I'm afraid it will be the same as the previous ones, so Huzi said, not for the time being. I want to save some money and go to the county later.\" Jia Shi nodded: \"That's fine, it's always a miscarriage.\" \"Yeah.\" Yu Xiaohe smiled and said, \"Then we'll go back and have a good rest.\" \"Okay, I'll give it to you.\" \"No, you have a good rest.\" Yu Xiaohe put his hand on her hand, indicating that she should stop without seeing her off, and then said to Ye: \"Auntie, I'm leaving first.\" \"Okay, come and stay with Zhiyan when you have time.\" Ye walked over, took out a few pieces of silver from his sleeves, put them in Yu Xiaohe's hand, and said, \"This is all that's left, please return it to your family first.", "title_en": "Chapter 10"}